<slide xmlns="http://www.larkoffice.com/sml/2.0" id="p5-leb">
  <style>
    <fill><fillColor color="rgb(247,249,250)"/></fill>
  </style>
  <data>
    <shape type="rect" topLeftX="40" topLeftY="60" width="8" height="110">
      <fill><fillColor color="rgb(88,124,160)"/></fill>
      <border color="rgb(88,124,160)" width="1"/>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="66" topLeftY="60" width="400" height="30">
      <content textType="caption" color="rgb(88,124,160)" bold="true">
        <p>MODULE 2 · 局部专家平衡</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="64" topLeftY="96" width="830" height="56">
      <content textType="headline" color="rgb(28,58,74)" bold="true">
        <p>LEB = Local Expert Balancing · 无标签下怎么判断“该更信哪个模态”？</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <line startX="64" startY="160" endX="896" endY="160">
      <border color="rgb(213,224,229)" width="2"/>
    </line>

    <!-- 左列：朴素加权的隐患 -->
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="58" topLeftY="178" width="400" height="30">
      <content textType="body" bold="true" color="rgb(150,80,72)">
        <p>⚠ 朴素加权/平均的隐患</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="rect" topLeftX="58" topLeftY="216" width="420" height="130" rx="6">
      <fill><fillColor color="rgb(253,242,240)"/></fill>
      <border color="rgb(231,199,194)" width="1"/>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="78" topLeftY="230" width="382" height="104" color="rgb(60,80,92)">
      <content textType="body" lineSpacing="multiple:1.4">
        <p>做完 DEF 后若只把图/文简单平均或全局一个权重，会掩盖“占比小但对这一簇内的病例才关键”的单模态信号——融合把少数派优势稀释了。</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <shape type="text" topLeftX="58" topLeftY="360" width="400" height="30">
      <content textType="body" bold="true" color="rgb(150,80,72)">
        <p>关键词</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="rect" topLeftX="58" topLeftY="396" width="420" height="86" rx="6">
      <fill><fillColor color="rgb(252,232,228)"/></fill>
      <border color="rgb(231,199,194)" width="1"/>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="78" topLeftY="408" width="384" height="64">
      <content textType="body" color="rgb(120,60,52)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35">
        <p>全局平均 → 让“局部”优势被抹平<br/>被吞的单模态 = 本可救回的信息</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <!-- 右列：LEB 机制 -->
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="520" topLeftY="178" width="400" height="30">
      <content textType="body" bold="true" color="rgb(13,108,112)">
        <p>✓ LEB：按局部可靠度再平衡</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="rect" topLeftX="520" topLeftY="216" width="388" height="130" rx="6">
      <fill><fillColor color="rgb(240,247,247)"/></fill>
      <border color="rgb(202,224,224)" width="1"/>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="540" topLeftY="230" width="352" height="104" color="rgb(60,80,92)">
      <content textType="body" lineSpacing="multiple:1.4">
        <p>无标签环境下，用「邻居内聚度 + 邻居熵」评估每个模态在局部邻域的可靠度；对更可靠的那个模态加重，防止融合吞掉它。</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <shape type="rect" topLeftX="520" topLeftY="360" width="388" height="122" rx="6">
      <fill><fillColor color="rgb(13,108,112)"/></fill>
      <border color="rgb(13,108,112)" width="1"/>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="540" topLeftY="372" width="352" height="100">
      <content textType="body" color="rgb(255,255,255)" lineSpacing="multiple:1.35">
        <p><strong>怎么没标签还打分：</strong> 看邻居靠不靠拢（内聚）与判断是否摇摆（熵）。越一致越可信 → 动态给该模态更高局部权重。</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <shape type="text" topLeftX="56" topLeftY="500" width="848" height="26">
      <content textType="caption" color="rgb(126,146,158)">
        <p>回应痛点2：图文重要度动态变化 → 在“无监督”里用一致性信号做局部仲裁。</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
  </data>
  <note>
    <content textType="body">
      <p>页5 · LEB：精妙在『没标签』三个字。判别式融合最怕少数派单模态优势被全局平均稀释；LEB 用邻居内聚+邻居熵做局部可靠度仲裁，给更可信模态加权。可跟导师讨论：熵越低是否总代表越可靠？边界情形在哪？</p>
    </content>
  </note>
</slide>
